# Code Review

Review the diff yourself. Do not spawn a fictional reviewer agent.

Before merge: unit + integration tests for the change; E2E for critical user flows; coverage still ≥ 80% on product code. Skip that bar for scripts, one-off tools, and this rules folder.

Checklist: names, 50/800/4 limits, errors handled, no secrets, no debug leftovers.

Auth, payments, user data, queries, filesystem, crypto, outbound HTTP → `common/security.mdc`. Task `security-review` only if the user asks.

CRITICAL/HIGH block merge. Watch injection, XSS, path traversal, CSRF, N+1, unbounded lists, mutation.
